== Fenced languages

%% These render as ordinary code fences in the 0.2 core. Language classes are
%% left to a syntax highlighter.

```mermaid
graph TD; a-->b;
```

```d2
a -> b
```

```plantuml
a -> b
```

```dot
digraph { a -> b }
```

```wavedrom
{ "signal": [] }
```

```abc
X:1
```

```vega-lite
{ "mark": "bar" }
```

```chart
{ "type": "bar" }
```

